# ── HumanPlus contact form (Web3Forms) ───────────────────────────────
# Get a FREE access key at https://web3forms.com — no backend required.
# The key is tied to the HumanPlus inbox (info@humanplus.xyz) on the
# Web3Forms dashboard, which stores every submission for you.
#
# IMPORTANT: never commit a real key. `.env` is gitignored; only this
